{"vcon":"0.4.0","uuid":"0195a7c2-3e41-7d10-9b2a-4f1e8c0d5a32","created_at":"2026-02-12T16:06:02Z","subject":"Crew radio call: Thames Street drain","parties":[{"tel":"+14015550175","name":"Marcus","role":"crew_lead"},{"tel":"+14015550110","name":"Paula Reis","role":"dispatcher"}],"dialog":[{"type":"text","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:00Z","duration":5,"parties":[0],"originator":0,"mediatype":"text/plain","encoding":"none","body":"Dispatch, it's Marcus. We're at the Thames Street corner on the Pucci work order."},{"type":"text","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:07Z","duration":4,"parties":[1],"originator":1,"mediatype":"text/plain","encoding":"none","body":"Go ahead, Marcus."},{"type":"text","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:13Z","duration":6,"parties":[0],"originator":0,"mediatype":"text/plain","encoding":"none","body":"Grate's clear. We pulled a lot of leaves and sand out and the water's moving for now."},{"type":"text","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:21Z","duration":10,"parties":[0],"originator":0,"mediatype":"text/plain","encoding":"none","body":"But I put the camera down the line. The pipe under the street is collapsed about twenty feet in. That's not a cleaning job. That's a rebuild."},{"type":"text","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:33Z","duration":4,"parties":[1],"originator":1,"mediatype":"text/plain","encoding":"none","body":"Okay. So do I close the work order?"},{"type":"text","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:39Z","duration":9,"parties":[0],"originator":0,"mediatype":"text/plain","encoding":"none","body":"Close the cleaning. Somebody needs to open something for the line. I told her it's a temporary fix. Next big storm, it backs up again."},{"type":"text","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:50Z","duration":4,"parties":[1],"originator":1,"mediatype":"text/plain","encoding":"none","body":"I'll mark it cleared and pass the rest to the supervisor."},{"type":"text","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:56Z","duration":4,"parties":[0],"originator":0,"mediatype":"text/plain","encoding":"none","body":"Thanks, Paula."}],"analysis":[],"attachments":[{"purpose":"tags","encoding":"json","start":"2026-02-12T16:05:00Z","party":0,"dialog":0,"body":["org:city-of-newport","department:public-works","resident:eleanor-pucci","location:lower-thames-street","step:crew-call","work-order:feb-10"]}]}